    <string name="settings_terms_content">
        By using Cestou, you agree to the following terms: \n\n
        1. App Use: Cestou is a tool for managing shopping lists.\n
        2. AI: The AI assistant is provided \"as is\" and may generate inaccurate information.\n
        3. Data: Your lists are securely synced via Firestore.\n
        4. Responsibility: We are not responsible for data loss due to device misuse.\n\n
        Version: 1.0.0
    </string>

    <string name="settings_privacy_content">
        Your privacy is our priority:\n\n
        1. Data Collection: We only collect your anonymous user ID and your shopping lists for synchronization.\n
        2. Sharing: We do not share your personal data with third parties for advertising purposes.\n
        3. Cookies: We do not use tracking cookies.\n
        4. Security: We use AES encryption to protect sensitive data on the device.\n\n
        Questions? Contact us at suporte@cestou.com.br
    </string>

